00:45:26.390 --> 00:45:27.224
Cha Su-yeon!

612
00:45:27.307 --> 00:45:28.517
-Labas!
-Labas!

613
00:45:28.600 --> 00:45:29.435
Cha Su-yeon!

614
00:45:29.518 --> 00:45:30.477
-Labas!
-Labas!

615
00:45:30.561 --> 00:45:31.395
Cha Su-yeon!

616
00:45:31.478 --> 00:45:32.396
-Labas!
-Labas!

617
00:45:32.479 --> 00:45:33.355
Cha Su-yeon!

618
00:45:33.439 --> 00:45:34.648
